  "methodology": "Enumerate every declared state; shallow-merge matching permutation components in order; evaluate bone_visibility; recursively sort object keys and preserve arrays; SHA-256 effective component JSON. Identifiers inside components, unused material bindings, collision, and tick behavior are retained. Block identifier/description and latent states are excluded.",
  "limitations": [
    "Component equivalence is not decoded-state or future editor equivalence.",
    "Different geometry identifiers are not resolved to mesh equivalence.",
    "Counts of unique signatures are not automatically realizable Cartesian state declarations; packed domains may require padding or ID splits.",
    "Planner restriction excludes arbitrary historical role/mask combinations and needs an explicit migration policy.",
    "No source definitions, worlds, schemas or packages are changed."
  ],
